g-jor","id":212674138,"node_id":"U_kgDODK0mWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212674138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor","html_url":"https://github.com/ping-jor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T21:41:48Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T21:41:48Z","body":"Hi everyone!  I just looked into this and submitted a PR with a fix.\n\nThe culprit here is that _CollisionShape3D_ and _CollisionPolygon3D_ don't possess an RID. So when the editor tries to exclude them during the raycast, it fails, and the raycast hits the parent body instead. \n\nI've updated  _insert_rid_recursive to explicitly check for these shapes and extract their parent's RID to add to the exclude list. Hopefully, this gets reviewed and merged soon!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4468258786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]